sequenceDiagram
    title BLE GATT Discovery and Notification Enable Example

    participant App as App<br>[implements GattClientResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GattClient]
    participant Peripheral as BLE Peripheral

    Note over Node, Peripheral: Messages between Node and BLE Peripheral<br>are link-layer / ATT events, not driven by the App.<br>The App only observes them through Echo callbacks.

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: Service Discovery
        App->>Node: GattClient.StartServiceDiscovery()

        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ServiceDiscovered(uuid=0x1801)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ServiceDiscovered(uuid=0x1800)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ServiceDiscovered(uuid=0x180A)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ServiceDiscovered(<br>uuid=1bc5d5a502005e8be2115f0de070a946)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ServiceDiscovered(<br>uuid=0xFFF0,<br>handles={startHandle=64, endHandle=69})
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ServiceDiscovered(uuid=0x180F)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ServiceDiscovered(uuid=0x180D)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ServiceDiscoveryComplete(success)

        note over App: uuid=0xFFF0 is the vendor-defined target service.<br>Interpreted as Bluetooth 16-bit UUID.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: Characteristic Discovery for the target service
        App->>Node: GattClient.StartCharacteristicDiscovery(<br>startHandle=64, endHandle=69)

        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.CharacteristicDiscovered(<br>uuid=0xFFF1, declarationHandle=65, valueHandle=66, properties=0x10)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.CharacteristicDiscovered(<br>uuid=0xFFF2, declarationHandle=68, valueHandle=69, properties=0x02)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.CharacteristicDiscoveryComplete(success)

        note over App: uuid=0xFFF1 is a notify characteristic.<br>uuid=0xFFF2 is a read characteristic.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: Descriptor Discovery for the notify characteristic

        note over App: For characteristic with valueHandle=66,<br>the descriptor range is 66..67<br>(next declarationHandle=68 minus 1).

        App->>Node: GattClient.StartDescriptorDiscovery(<br>startHandle=66, endHandle=67)

        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.DescriptorDiscovered(<br>uuid=0x2902, handle=67)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.DescriptorDiscoveryComplete(success)

        note over App: uuid=0x2902 is the Client Characteristic<br>Configuration Descriptor (CCCD).<br>Controls notification / indication enablement<br>for value handle 66.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: Enable Notifications
        App->>Node: GattClient.WriteDescriptor(<br>handle=67, data=0x0100)
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_WRITE_REQ (handle=67, value=0x0100)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_WRITE_RSP
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)

        note over App: data=0x0100 enables notifications.<br>Subscribes to notifications from value handle 66.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: Runtime Notifications
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_HANDLE_VALUE_NTF (handle=66, value=<vendor bytes>)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.NotificationReceived(<br>handle=66,<br>data=1fff07ff07ff07ff07ff07ff070020282000ff07)

        note over App: Payload decoded per the vendor characteristic definition.<br>The App is responsible for parsing the notification bytes according<br>to the target service's specification.

        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_HANDLE_VALUE_NTF (handle=66, value=<vendor bytes>)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.NotificationReceived(<br>handle=66,<br>data=1fff07ff07ff07ff07ff07ff070020280000ff07)
    end
